```
Reason:
The variable `tord` is initialized to `-1`, meaning that if no true values are found in the segment, it defaults to `-1`. Consequently, when evaluating the boolean value with `sindex.getOrd(doc)`, documents without a value are incorrectly treated as having a true value if no other documents in the segment have a true value.

